{"seq":3,"slug":"pruning-operations-early-stopping-and-troubleshooting","title":"剪枝实操与异常排查：异步调度、误杀诊断与训练曲线噪声治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/automl-hyperparameter-optimization-engineering/multifidelity-pruning-asha-hyperband/pruning-operations-early-stopping-and-troubleshooting","wordCount":2717,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"剪枝实操与异常排查-异步调度-误杀诊断与训练曲线噪声治理\">剪枝实操与异常排查：异步调度、误杀诊断与训练曲线噪声治理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念-异步调度把-剪枝-从批处理变成了状态机\">核心概念：异步调度把「剪枝」从批处理变成了状态机</h2><p>剪枝的理论（逐次减半、Hyperband 的 bracket 公式）讲的是<strong>预算如何分配</strong>，而实操遇到的第一个问题是<strong>调度在真实集群上怎么跑</strong>。同步版 Successive Halving 要求一个 rung 里所有 trial 都报完同一档保真度才能集体排名——只要有一个慢 trial（数据加载抖动、被抢占、GPU 共享），整个 rung 全部阻塞。ASHA（Asynchronous Successive Halving Algorithm，Li 等，MLSys 2020，arXiv:1810.05934）的改造非常直接：<strong>去掉同步屏障，trial 一上报中间结果，调度器立刻拿它和当前 rung 里已有的同侪比较，够好就升级，不够好就当场停掉</strong>，不等任何人。</p>\n<p>这个改动把一个批处理排名问题，变成了一个<strong>持续运行的状态机</strong>。理解它之后，本章后续的误杀诊断、噪声治理才有统一的坐标系。三处关键运行时常量需要先钉死：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数（Optuna / Ray Tune 命名）</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>典型取值</th>\n<th>配错时的症状</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>min_resource</code> / <code>grace_period</code></td>\n<td>最小保真度，低于此值一律不剪</td>\n<td>5–20 epoch</td>\n<td>太小 → 早期噪声误杀；太大 → 剪枝失效、白烧预算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>reduction_factor</code> / <code>reduction_factor</code></td>\n<td>淘汰比例 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>3–4</td>\n<td>过大 → 一次淘汰太多、幸存者不可信；过小 → rung 层数爆炸</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>bootstrap_count</code> / 最短 rung 样本数</td>\n<td>启动同侪比较前至少攒够几个 trial</td>\n<td>5–10</td>\n<td>太小 → 单点噪声决定生死；太大 → 迟迟不剪</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>同一套语义在 Optuna 的 <code>HyperbandPruner</code>（<code>n_brackets</code>、<code>min_resource</code>、<code>reduction_factor</code>，见 <a href=\"https://optuna.readthedocs.io/en/stable/reference/generated/optuna.pruners.HyperbandPruner.html\">https://optuna.readthedocs.io/en/stable/reference/generated/optuna.pruners.HyperbandPruner.html</a> ）和 Ray Tune 的 <code>ASHAScheduler</code>（默认 <code>grace_period=1</code>、<code>reduction_factor=4</code>、<code>brackets=1</code>，见 <a href=\"https://docs.ray.io/en/latest/tune/api/doc/ray.tune.schedulers.ASHAScheduler.html\">https://docs.ray.io/en/latest/tune/api/doc/ray.tune.schedulers.ASHAScheduler.html</a> ）里都成立。rung 的边界与升级规则本身由上一节的机制决定，见同一章节的 <a href=\"hyperband-asha-successive-halving-mechanics\">Hyperband、ASHA 与 BOHB 机制</a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;trial 训练若干 step&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;上报中间结果&lt;br/&gt;report(step, metric)&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C{&quot;step &lt; grace_period?&quot;}&#10;    C --&gt;|是| A&#10;    C --&gt;|否| D[&quot;定位 rung&lt;br/&gt;rung = step 对应的档位&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E{&quot;该 rung 已攒够&lt;br/&gt;同侪数?&quot;}&#10;    E --&gt;|否| F[&quot;暂不决策&lt;br/&gt;继续训练&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt;|是| G{&quot;排名在前 1/eta ?&quot;}&#10;    G --&gt;|是| H[&quot;promote&lt;br/&gt;预算升到下一档&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt;|否| I[&quot;STOP&lt;br/&gt;记录被剪时刻与排名&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; A&#10;    H --&gt; A\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"trial 训练若干 step\"] --&gt; B[\"上报中间结果&lt;br/&gt;report(step, metric)\"]\n    B --&gt; C{\"step &lt; grace_period?\"}\n    C --&gt;|是| A\n    C --&gt;|否| D[\"定位 rung&lt;br/&gt;rung = step 对应的档位\"]\n    D --&gt; E{\"该 rung 已攒够&lt;br/&gt;同侪数?\"}\n    E --&gt;|否| F[\"暂不决策&lt;br/&gt;继续训练\"]\n    E --&gt;|是| G{\"排名在前 1/eta ?\"}\n    G --&gt;|是| H[\"promote&lt;br/&gt;预算升到下一档\"]\n    G --&gt;|否| I[\"STOP&lt;br/&gt;记录被剪时刻与排名\"]\n    F --&gt; A\n    H --&gt; A</pre><h2 id=\"异步账本的会计问题-promotion-数会超过-rung-容量\">异步账本的会计问题：promotion 数会超过 rung 容量</h2><p>异步化带来一个反直觉的副作用：<strong>同一个 rung 里被升级的 trial 数，可能超过同步做法下该 rung 的容量</strong>。原因是「前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span>」这个判据在异步下是对<strong>当前已到达的 trial 集合</strong>做比较，而不是对一个固定大小的完整批次。最先到的若干 trial 里只要相对靠前就能升降级——它们享受了「先到先得」的先发优势，晚到的强 trial 反而因为名额已被占而被迫和更严的基线比较。</p>\n<p>这不是 bug，是 ASHA 用少量预算换取无阻塞吞吐的代价，但必须显式管理：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>看 <code>n_brackets</code> / 并发上限，而不是看理论公式</strong>。Optuna 的 HyperbandPruner 只有在设置了 <code>min_resource</code> 和 <code>reduction_factor</code> 后才会推导 bracket，<code>n_brackets</code> 默认按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>η</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>min_resource</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lfloor \\log_\\eta(R/\\text{min\\_resource}) \\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1302em;vertical-align:-0.3802em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0573em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">min_resource</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)⌋</span></span></span></span></span> 自动算；真实并行度上限往往由集群 worker 数而非 bracket 决定。</li>\n<li><strong>给调度状态做可观测性</strong>。Ray Tune 会把每个 trial 的 <code>trial_id</code>、<code>last_result</code> 写入 <code>Trial</code> 状态，<code>ASHAScheduler</code> 的决策经 TensorBoard 事件流可观察；Optuna 侧用 <code>study.trials_dataframe()</code> 导出 <code>intermediate_values</code> 与 <code>state</code>（<code>PRUNED</code> / <code>COMPLETE</code>）后即可重放每一次剪枝。缺了这一步，误杀诊断无从下手。</li>\n<li><strong>resume 后 rung 状态必须能重建</strong>。Ray Tune 用 checkpoint 恢复 trial，但<strong>调度器的 rung 归属不随 checkpoint 自动落盘</strong>；恢复一个被中断的实验时，最稳的做法是把已 <code>PRUNED</code> 的 trial 的中间值一次性回填给新的 scheduler 实例，否则新 rung 从零开始，会重复淘汰旧 trial 已经淘汰过的区域。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"误杀诊断-区分-噪声误杀-与-保真度误杀\">误杀诊断：区分「噪声误杀」与「保真度误杀」</h2><p><strong>误杀（misfire）指剪枝剪掉了如果继续训练本会成为最优的 trial。</strong> 它是多保真剪枝最贵的错误——你不仅损失了那个配置，还让搜索器误以为该区域差，把后续采样也带偏。诊断的第一步是<strong>分类</strong>，因为两类误杀的修法完全相反。</p>\n<p><strong>第一类：噪声误杀。</strong> 早期验证指标方差极大，一个幸运的随机种子就能排到前面，一个不幸的排在后面被剪。判别方法：看被剪 trial 的<strong>末值是否落在同保真度下未剪 trial 的置信区间内</strong>。若被剪 trial 的指标只是略低于 <code>grace_period</code> 结束时的中位数，且曲线抖动幅度（滚动标准差）接近或超过这条差距，就是噪声主导，剪枝判据不可靠。</p>\n<p><strong>第二类：保真度误杀。</strong> 曲线存在<strong>交叉</strong>——某 trial 在小预算下一路领先，但增长率低，拉长预算会被反超；或反之，起步差的配置后期陡增。这类误杀的信号是<strong>被剪 trial 的曲线斜率</strong>：如果它的最后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 步相对增长率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta y_k / y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span> 明显高于幸存者，说明它被截断在上升期。这正是 MFES（arXiv:2301.13659）所说的 ill-defined fidelity 问题在实操中的表现——低保真排名与全保真排名的秩相关性 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 低于可用门槛时，剪枝是系统性有害的。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msubsup><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho_s\\big(y(\\cdot, r),\\, y(\\cdot, r_{\\max})\\big) = 1 - \\frac{6\\sum_{i=1}^{n} d_i^2}{n(n^2-1)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4398em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5038em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6897em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2587em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>工程上的分诊表：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>症状</th>\n<th>根因</th>\n<th>首选对策</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>被剪 trial 末值与中位数差距 &lt; 曲线滚动标准差</td>\n<td>早期噪声主导</td>\n<td>提高 <code>grace_period</code>；指标做 EMA 平滑；固定数据顺序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>被剪 trial 末段斜率明显高于幸存者</td>\n<td>保真度交叉 / 曲线未到拐点</td>\n<td>提高 <code>min_resource</code>；对指标做单调变换（如 rank 化）再比较</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>剪枝率畸高（&gt;90% 在第一个 rung 就被砍）</td>\n<td>判据方向写反或 metric 尺度错</td>\n<td>检查 <code>mode=&#39;max&#39;/&#39;min&#39;</code>；确认优化的是同一个指标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>好配置在多次重复实验里忽而存活忽而被剪</td>\n<td>reduction_factor 过小 + 同侪数不足</td>\n<td>加大 <code>reduction_factor</code> 到 3–4；增加 <code>bootstrap_count</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学习率相关配置总在低保真被剪</td>\n<td>保真度敏感超参数</td>\n<td>把 lr/batch size 排除出低保真搜索空间，或固定为平滑值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>判别「误杀」需要<strong>离线重放</strong>能力：把被剪 trial 的中间值留存，事后用同一份数据训练到更高保真度对账。这是唯一能给出因果结论的证据，仅凭观察被剪分布只能得到相关性。低保真偏差与秩相关的完整机理，见同一章节的 <a href=\"multifidelity-evaluation-and-fidelity-scheduling\">多保真评估模型</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"训练曲线噪声治理-从源头压低方差\">训练曲线噪声治理：从源头压低方差</h2><p>误杀诊断告诉你「剪错了」，噪声治理告诉你「怎么让剪枝判据不那么容易被骗」。核心思路是<strong>别用瞬时值做决策，用降噪后的趋势做决策</strong>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>验证指标做指数滑动平均（EMA）</strong>。对上报给调度器的中间值套一层 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{y}_t = \\alpha y_t + (1-\\alpha)\\hat{y}_{t-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.1</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>0.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.1\\sim0.3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.3</span></span></span></span></span>），能显著削掉 mini-batch 级别的抖动，代价是引入约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 步的滞后——所以 EMA 必须配合更大的 <code>grace_period</code>，否则平滑过的值和原始值一样卡在 warmup 里。</li>\n<li><strong>固定验证子集</strong>。验证集越小、越动态，指标方差越大。对策是评估阶段用固定子集，只在资源极紧张时才采样子集。</li>\n<li><strong>跳过 warmup 段再比较</strong>。最初几百步的损失由初始化与学习率预热决定，与最终泛化弱相关；<code>grace_period</code> 的作用之一就是让所有 trial 越过这段不可比区域再排名。</li>\n<li><strong>控制随机性来源</strong>。数据增强强度、dropout、shuffle 顺序都会叠加噪声；对比实验里固定 seed 与数据顺序能显著提升 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><strong>指标本身要可比较</strong>。跨 trial 用同一验证集、同一评测频率、同一聚合方式（末值 vs 最优值）。用「历史最优」上报时曲线天然单调、噪声更小，但会掩盖过拟合——两种口径不可混用。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>噪声治理的效果可以量化：在同样 <code>grace_period</code> 下对指标做 EMA 后重放，若被剪集合里「曲线斜率领先」那批的比例下降，说明降噪真的减少了保真度误杀，而不只是推迟了决策。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与采样器的耦合-以及一份上线前检查清单\">与采样器的耦合，以及一份上线前检查清单</h2><p>剪枝从来不是孤立组件。BOHB（Falkner 等，ICML 2018，arXiv:1807.01774）把 Hyperband 的调度和基于核密度估计的贝叶斯采样器绑在一起：<strong>被剪 trial 的低保真观测不是垃圾，而是喂给密度模型的样本</strong>。这意味着两件事：其一，剪枝太激进会让密度模型只看到好区域，过早收敛到局部最优；其二，低保真观测需要按保真度分层建模，否则不同 epoch 数的指标混在一起会污染模型。Optuna 的 <code>TPESampler</code> 与 <code>HyperbandPruner</code> 组合、Ray Tune 的 <code>BOHB</code> 调度器都实现了这种分层。树模型与 bandit 采样的更多细节见 <a href=\"../bayesian-optimization-surrogate/tree-based-surrogates-tpe-smac-and-batch-bo\">基于树的代理模型与批处理贝叶斯优化</a>。</p>\n<p>上线前按下面清单逐项核对，能拦掉绝大多数「剪枝在跑但结果是垃圾」的失败：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>指标方向</strong>：<code>mode</code> / <code>direction</code> 与优化目标一致（最小化验证损失 vs 最大化验证准确率），写反会让调度器专门剪掉好 trial。</li>\n<li><strong>保真度单调</strong>：上报的 <code>step</code>/<code>epoch</code> 必须严格递增，重复或回退的 step 会让 rung 定位错乱。</li>\n<li><strong>最小保真度 &gt; 0</strong>：<code>grace_period</code> / <code>min_resource</code> 不得为 0，否则第一个上报点就可能触发剪枝。</li>\n<li><strong>被剪可追溯</strong>：每个被剪 trial 落盘「剪枝时的 step、当时的指标、所在 rung、同侪排名」四元组，供离线重放。</li>\n<li><strong>异常不被当噪声</strong>：训练发散（NaN/Inf）应由异常处理直接终止，而不是混进排名——一个报 NaN 的 trial 若按「损失很大」被剪，会掩盖真实的数据或数值问题。</li>\n<li><strong>预算确实省下来了</strong>：统计「剪枝节省的步数 / 总步数」；若节省比例接近 0，说明 <code>grace_period</code> 或 <code>reduction_factor</code> 配得过松，剪枝形同虚设。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>异步 ASHA 把剪枝从批处理排名变成持续状态机，好处是无阻塞吞吐，代价是 promotion 数可能超出 rung 容量——必须用可观测性显式管理，而不是相信理论公式。</li>\n<li>误杀分两类：<strong>噪声误杀</strong>（早期方差主导）和<strong>保真度误杀</strong>（曲线交叉、秩相关不足）。两者的修法不同，判别靠留存的中间值做离线重放。</li>\n<li>判据要建在降噪后的趋势上：EMA 平滑、固定验证子集、越过 warmup 再比较、统一评测口径——每一项都是在压低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的方差、抬高它与全保真的相关性。</li>\n<li>剪枝与采样器耦合：被剪观测是 BOHB 密度模型的养分，太激进会过早收敛；低保真观测必须分层建模。</li>\n<li>上线前逐项核对指标方向、保真度单调性、最小保真度、被剪可追溯、异常处理、以及「预算是否真的省了」。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"剪枝实操与异常排查：异步调度、误杀诊断与训练曲线噪声治理","id":"剪枝实操与异常排查-异步调度-误杀诊断与训练曲线噪声治理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：异步调度把「剪枝」从批处理变成了状态机","id":"核心概念-异步调度把-剪枝-从批处理变成了状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"异步账本的会计问题：promotion 数会超过 rung 容量","id":"异步账本的会计问题-promotion-数会超过-rung-容量"},{"level":2,"text":"误杀诊断：区分「噪声误杀」与「保真度误杀」","id":"误杀诊断-区分-噪声误杀-与-保真度误杀"},{"level":2,"text":"训练曲线噪声治理：从源头压低方差","id":"训练曲线噪声治理-从源头压低方差"},{"level":2,"text":"与采样器的耦合，以及一份上线前检查清单","id":"与采样器的耦合-以及一份上线前检查清单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Hyperband、ASHA 与 BOHB 机制：逐次减半、资源分配与早停判定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/automl-hyperparameter-optimization-engineering/multifidelity-pruning-asha-hyperband/hyperband-asha-successive-halving-mechanics"},"next":{"title":"神经架构搜索概念：搜索空间、权重共享与可微分架构搜索","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/automl-hyperparameter-optimization-engineering/automl-platform-nas-operations/nas-search-space-and-weight-sharing-concepts"}}